## 7. Best Practices

- **Always confirm specifications** before starting implementation
- **Use cmd /c wrapper** for uu5Generate commands
- **Configure seriesList** based on object attributes from schema
- **Exclude system attributes** (sysCts, sysMts, sysRev) from seriesList
- **Integrate create and detail components** when they exist in the same module
- **Use Badge components** for state fields with proper color schemes
- **Use DateTime components** for date/datetime fields with right alignment
- **Remove default filter/sorter values** generated by uu5Generate
- **Configure meaningful titles** and subtitles for better UX
- **Test with real data** before considering implementation complete

## 8. Troubleshooting

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| uu5Generate prompts for input | Missing parameters | Always include ALL parameters (--sub-app, --brick-uu5-tag, --redirect-uu5-route) |
| PowerShell command fails | Using PowerShell directly | Always use cmd /c wrapper for uu5Generate commands |
| List data not displaying | Wrong seriesList configuration | Verify dataItem functions extract correct data from entityDto.data |
| WorkspaceProvider errors | Unnecessary workspace dependency | Remove WorkspaceProvider and use baseUri directly |
| Create button not showing | ActionList not configured | Add Create component to actionList in list view |
| Detail modal not opening | Missing useModal or incorrect handler | Import useModal and implement proper handler |
| State badges not rendering | Missing Badge component or helpers | Import Badge and add helper methods (toCamelCase, getStateColorScheme) |
| Date alignment incorrect | Missing horizontalAlignment prop | Add horizontalAlignment: "right" and use DateTime component |
| Default filters showing | Default values not removed | Remove filterList and sorterList from defaultProps |
| Compilation fails | Syntax errors or missing imports | Fix imports, check syntax, and re-run build |